#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (gi-docgen is also provided as a meson "
"subproject, which will be used if <option>-D gtk_doc=false</option> is not "
