"format), and <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pylint/\">pylint</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (gi-docgen também é fornecido como um "
"subprojeto meson, que será usado se <option>-D gtk_doc=false</option> não "
"for passado para <command>meson</command>), <xref linkend=\"llvm\"/> (para "
"formato clang) e <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pylint/\">pylint</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libgweather"
msgstr "Instalação do libgweather"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix an issue in the shipped geolocation data:"
msgstr "Corrigir um problema nos dados de geolocalização enviados:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../libgweather-&libgweather-"
"version;-upstream_fix-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../libgweather-&libgweather-"
"version;-upstream_fix-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libgweather</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libgweather</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D gtk_doc=false    \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D gtk_doc=false    \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar construir a "
"documentação da API para esse pacote, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:138
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"s/libgweather_full_version/'libgweather-&libgweather-version;'/\" \\\n"
"    -i ../doc/meson.build                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D gtk_doc=true                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"s/libgweather_full_version/'libgweather-&libgweather-version;'/\" \\\n"
"    -i ../doc/meson.build                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D gtk_doc=true                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One test needs that the locale files be installed on the system, so it is "
"better to run the tests after installing the package."
msgstr ""
"Um teste precisa que os arquivos de localidade estejam instalados no "
"sistema, de forma que é melhor executar os testes depois de instalar o "
"pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:152
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>LC_ALL=C ninja test</command>. One "
"test, <filename>metar</filename>, is known to fail due to some airport "
"weather information being temporarily unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>LC_ALL=C ninja test</command>. Um"
" teste, <filename>metar</filename>, é conhecido por falhar devido a algumas "
"informações meteorológicas do aeroporto estarem temporariamente "
"indisponíveis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

